==Tailoring==
Acorn can be used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create the {{Name|Beanie|class=inline}}. It can also be used as an orange dye in the dye pots located in [[Haley]]'s and [[Emily]]'s house, [[2 Willow Lane]].

==Quests==
Two or three Acorns may be requested by several fish in [[Fish Pond#Quests|Fish Pond quests]].

